      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Article 280 provides the constitutional framework for the Finance Commission.",
        "The President of India has the mandatory duty to constitute the Finance Commission.",
        "The commission must be formed every five years, or sooner if required."
      ],
