    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Questions frequently test which Article deals with the Finance Commission (Article 280).",
        "Pay attention to the constituting authority: It is the President, not Parliament or the Prime Minister.",
        "Note the duration flexibility: The standard interval is 5 years, but it can be constituted earlier if necessary."
      ],
